   "zh": "第二遍旋律交给长笛和单簧管，大管跟着低音走。",
   "en": "In the second round flute and clarinet take the tune; the bassoon follows the bass."
  },
  "br": {
   "zh": "开头圆号吹出最有名的那三个音，后面接话、垫和弦。",
   "en": "A horn plays the famous first three notes, then answers and fills in chords."
  },
  "perc": {
   "zh": "最后一遍定音鼓加进来，收尾一下镲。",
   "en": "Timpani join in the last round; one cymbal crash ends it."
  }
 }
